+<main>
+<h1>Customisation carousel</h1>
+<p>Actual Godot App captures. Parts and paint designs preview on the car before purchase. The selected part receives a gold highlight; only the separate equip action can save or unlock it. Short landscape screens keep the live car visible and use a compact workbench.</p>
+<nav aria-label="Capture selection">
